OL,3,AJeff Bezos says he was 'heavily
OL,4,Ainvolved' in casting Robert Pattinson
OL,5,Aas new 007
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe role has typically gone to an actor
OL,8,Fwho is not as well-known at the time of
OL,9,Fcasting. But Bezos said in screen
OL,10,Ftests, "it was so obvious he is James
OL,11,FBond".
OL,13,FThis will be the first 007 not under
OL,14,Fcreative control of the Broccoli
OL,15,Ffamily, who has overseen the franchise
OL,16,Fsince its start in 1962. Amazon
OL,17,Fpurchased MGM in 2022.
